# # /osd/
#
# Open Synth Descriptors (OSD): an open format describing synthesizers,
# drum machines, controllers and music software beyond MIDI and OSC.
#
# https://w3id.org/osd/<version>/<kind>.schema.json redirects to the JSON
# Schema of that version, served from the specification's repository.
# https://w3id.org/osd/ redirects to that repository.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Romain Peyrichou
# GitHub username: roomi-fields

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^([0-9]+\.[0-9]+)/([a-z]+\.schema\.json)$ https://roomi-fields.github.io/open-synth-descriptors/schemas/$1/$2 [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^$ https://github.com/roomi-fields/open-synth-descriptors [R=302,L]
